# A stall must answer HTTP 200, not 404. A 404 fallback is a shop that
# crawlers and link unfurlers read as gone, and the shared link is the whole
# product.
#
# Scoped to /s/* on purpose. A bare /* rewrite would serve index.html for a
# missing hashed asset, which means HTML delivered as JavaScript.
/s/* /index.html 200

# One origin, or browser storage splits in two. Cloudflare may also need this
# as a dashboard redirect rule for the apex to own the www hostname.
https://www.stall.cash/* https://stall.cash/:splat 301
